    "detailed_description": "Battlechat is a 2D multiplayer game for Twitch streamers where their followers can compete against each other with just simple commands via chat on different maps.<br>As a player you can...<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>control your character through the grid of the different maps.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>place bombs to get rid of your opponents.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>get stronger by collecting different powerups.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665400/extras/197004b6c046d68e1ffd0f0181a1bd06.webp?t=1723134144\" width=16 height=16 /></span>Increases the radius of your explosions.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665400/extras/b442c1155a0ce2aaf12a13c60fed5188.webp?t=1723134144\" width=16 height=16 /></span>Move faster through the map.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665400/extras/b718a7bb4031f1c4cc99b684a41b7e3a.webp?t=1723134144\" width=16 height=16 /></span>Reduce explosion delay, make sure you're not around when it happens.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665400/extras/91c4b80163cc1977efdb5258fd99952b.webp?t=1723134144\" width=16 height=16 /></span>Careful! You will lose a life if you touch it.<br><br>As Twitch streamer you can...<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>join the game and compete against your followers.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>manage and control the game by placing 'powerups'.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>both. why not?</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>set a maximum number of players.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>set game time.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Just make sure you stream everything.</h2>",
